"""GraphCast one-click quickstart — auto-detect platform, start container, run train/infer.

Usage:
  ./quickstart [MODE] [OPTIONS...]
  ./quickstart train --steps 10 --flagos-mode flaggems
  ./quickstart --rm infer
  ./quickstart --container-only           # just start container, don't run anything
  ./quickstart --image IMAGE train        # use custom Docker image
"""

